lass=\"sc-eVqvcJ hYMEQF\"><h2 class=\"sc-dntSTA kfua-Dq sc-kvnevz doYsMw\" data-test=\"latestJobOffersHeading\">Soortgelijke vacatures</h2><ul class=\"sc-ggWZvA hvwseS sc-a1856ae0-0 dljhmG\"><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe bvFFGc\"><a target=\"\" class=\"sc-erPUmh fJzVEA sc-6831826b-1 hNeaoI\" mb=\"3\" data-test=\"jobOfferCard\" aria-label=\"Business consultant\" href=\"/vacatures/business-consultant-16207\"><div class=\"sc-bRKDuR eEerQB sc-dedc8a65-0 kNcTRR sc-6831826b-0 gzFwag\" data-test=\"jobCardHeading\"><h3 class=\"sc-dntSTA iCifBV sc-kvnevz doYsMw sc-dedc8a65-1 BsWZH heading-xs\" data-test=\"jobOfferCardHeading\">Business consultant</h3><div class=\"sc-dedc8a65-2 jkhVcX\"><button data-test=\"favoriteJobOffer\" aria-label=\"Vacature als favoriet opslaan\" class=\"sc-cCVJLD kZWxiy sc-2b063218-0 ghidaJ sc-dedc8a65-3 rcHCc\"></button></div></div><p data-test=\"jobOfferCardParagraph\">De energietransitie verandert in hoog tempo. Waar we vroeger vooral gericht waren op stabiliteit en beheer, draait het nu om flexibiliteit, slimme sturing en toekomstbestendigheid. Denk aan het benutten van data om het energienet...</p><ul data-test=\"jobOfferCardIconList\" class=\"sc-ggWZvA hvwseS sc-43d08f06-0 iAwhXn sc-6831826b-3 IACUP\"><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">Den Bosch</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">Hoogspanning</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">HBO</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">€ 4.223,- en € 6.033,-</span></li></ul></a></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe bvFFGc\"><a target=\"\" class=\"sc-erPUmh fJzVEA sc-6831826b-1 hNeaoI\" mb=\"3\" data-test=\"jobOfferCard\" aria-label=\"Project engineer elektrotechniek\" href=\"/vacatures/project-engineer-elektrotechniek-14737\"><div class=\"sc-bRKDuR eEerQB sc-dedc8a65-0 kNcTRR sc-6831826b-0 gzFwag\" data-test=\"jobCardHeading\"><h3 class=\"sc-dntSTA iCifBV sc-kvnevz doYsMw sc-dedc8a65-1 BsWZH heading-xs\" data-test=\"jobOfferCardHeading\">Project engineer elektrotechniek</h3><div class=\"sc-dedc8a65-2 jkhVcX\"><button data-test=\"favoriteJobOffer\" aria-label=\"Vacature als favoriet opslaan\" class=\"sc-cCVJLD kZWxiy sc-2b063218-0 ghidaJ sc-dedc8a65-3 rcHCc\"></button></div></div><p data-test=\"jobOfferCardParagraph\">Speel een cruciale rol in de spannende wereld van hoogspanningsstations in de rol van project engineer elektrotechniek.</p><ul data-test=\"jobOfferCardIconList\" class=\"sc-ggWZvA hvwseS sc-43d08f06-0 iAwhXn sc-6831826b-3 IACUP\"><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">Weert</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">Hoogspanning</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">HBO</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">€ 3.732,- en € 5.331,-</span></li></ul></a></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe bvFFGc\"><a target=\"\" class=\"sc-erPUmh fJzVEA sc-6831826b-1 hNeaoI\" mb=\"3\" data-test=\"jobOfferCard\" aria-label=\"Site manager\" href=\"/vacatures/site-manager-15682\"><div class=\"sc-bRKDuR eEerQB sc-dedc8a65-0 kNcTRR sc-6831826b-0 gzFwag\" data-test=\"jobCardHeading\"><h3 class=\"sc-dntSTA iCifBV sc-kvnevz doYsMw sc-dedc8a65-1 BsWZH heading-xs\" data-test=\"jobOfferCardHeading\">Site manager</h3><div class=\"sc-dedc8a65-2 jkhVcX\"><button data-test=\"favoriteJobOffer\" aria-label=\"Vacature als favoriet opslaan\" class=\"sc-cCVJLD kZWxiy sc-2b063218-0 ghidaJ sc-dedc8a65-3 rcHCc\"></button></div></div><p data-test=\"jobOfferCardParagraph\">Wil jij ook impact maken binnen de energietransitie? Reageer dan direct op uitdagende rol van site manager.</p><ul data-test=\"jobOfferCardIconList\" class=\"sc-ggWZvA hvwseS sc-43d08f06-0 iAwhXn sc-6831826b-3 IACUP\"><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">Weert</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">Hoogspanning</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">HBO</span></li><li class=\"sc-jwTyAe cXZRIB\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ ckvFBk\">€ 4.223,- en € 6.033,-</span></li></ul></a></li></ul><a href=\"/vacatures?workArea=hoogspanning\" data-test=\"latestJobOffersButton\" class=\"sc-cCVJLD bqzaQN\"><span class=\"sc-dTvVRJ jvNhrk\">Bekijk alle soortgelijke vacatures</span></a></div></section><!--/$--></main></div></div></body></html>",
